    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lofi Cafe</strong> is a gamified focus tool, set to a soothing lofi soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your cozy virtual space with character, and boost your productivity with a collection of features designed to improve concentration and reduce stress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft, soothing music and immersive soundscapes like gentle rain and flowing rivers create the perfect ambient backdrop to relieve stress and help you unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download your character from Steam Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Character Animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take ScreenShots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Lightings</p></li></ul>",
